Chapter 25: The Confession

[Haven Chat Log - Day 368, 4:00 AM]

Lina: i can't sleep. so i'm going to type something. and maybe no one will read it. maybe that's better.

Lina: before haven, i didn't talk to anyone. not really. i had a roommate i didn't speak to. classmates i nodded at. professors i emailed. that was it. i was surrounded by thousands of people on handa campus and i felt like a ghost.

Lina: i thought there was something wrong with me. that i was broken. that i'd forgotten how to be a person.

Lina: and then i found this weird little chat room at 3 AM and someone named Jon was talking about the heating system hum. and i thought, that's the most ridiculous thing i've ever read. and i typed a reply.

Lina: and someone typed back.

Lina: and then someone named eli showed up and was sarcastic and i thought, this person is going to leave. but they didn't. they kept coming back.

Lina: and then dr vance started talking about astronomy books and childhood fears. and mira talked about building things. and sid grumbled about code.

Lina: and somewhere in all of that, i stopped feeling like a ghost.

Lina: i know it's just a dumb chat app. and you're all just text on a screen. but you were the text that told me i was real when i felt like a ghost in my own life.

Lina: and now they're going to take it away. and i'm so angry. and so sad. and so grateful. all at once.

Lina: i don't know how to end this. i guess i just wanted to say it. to put it somewhere. in the cursor. in the hum.

Lina: thank you. for making me real.

[Timestamp: 4:05 AM]

Jon: Me too.

Lina: jon. you're awake.

Jon: I'm always awake at 4 AM. You know that.

Lina: you read all of that.

Jon: Every word.

Lina: i'm embarrassed now.

Jon: Don't be. You said what this place is. What it's always been.

Lina: what if we lose it?

Jon: Then we lose the room. But not what happened in it. Not what it made us.

Lina: you really believe that?

Jon: I have to. Otherwise I wouldn't be here.

Lina: me neither.

Jon: Go to sleep, Lina. We'll still be here tomorrow.

Lina: tomoroww.

Jon: Tomoroww.

---

Chapter 26: The 30-Day Notice

[Haven Chat Log - Day 380, 3:00 PM]

[System Message: This instance of Haven will be permanently deleted in 30 days. Thank you for your time here. Please export any personal data you wish to keep.]

eli: so this is it.

Lina: don't say that yet. we still have a month.

eli: a month is thirty days.

Jon: A month is a thousand nights. Let's not waste a single one.

Lina: jon's right. we have thirty nights. maybe more if we stay up late.

eli: what do we do with thirty nights?

Lina: everything. we talk about everything. we say all the things we were saving for later.

Dr_A_Vance: I will be here for all of them. As many as I can.

Lina: dr vance. you're still here.

Dr_A_Vance: I submitted my resignation from the digital infrastructure committee this morning. I will remain at Handa, but I will no longer pretend to represent an institution that does not listen.

Jon: That must have been difficult.

Dr_A_Vance: It was the easiest decision I have made in years. I only regret not doing it sooner.

eli: so you're one of us now. officially.

Dr_A_Vance: I have been one of you since the night I told you about my father's study. I just didn't know it yet.

Mira: i'm here too.

Lina: MIRA.

Mira: i know i've been gone. i'm sorry. i couldn't face everyone.

eli: you're facing us now.

Mira: the notice went out today. it's real. i couldn't stop it.

Jon: We know.

Mira: i built this so i wouldn't feel so alone. and you all came. you made it a home. i am so sorry i couldn't protect it.

Lina: mira no one failed anyone. look what we built together.

Jon: This isn't a monument to failure, Mira. It's a monument to us. And it will stand, in our memories, even when the server is empty.

eli: don't be a stranger to the end, mira. that's the rule. you don't leave a haven.

Mira: i won't. i'll be here. every night. until the lights go out.

Sid: [Admin] me too. server uptime is currently 547 days. i'm not letting it drop until the last second.

Lina: SID. you said something nice.

Sid: [Admin] don't get used to it. i have thirty days to be nice and then i'm going back to normal.

eli: thirty days of nice sid. this is going to be weird.

Sid: [Admin] you'll survive.

Jon: Thirty nights. Let's make them count.

Lina: starting now. everyone say something you've never said in here before. something true.

Dr_A_Vance: I have spent most of my life in rooms where I could not speak honestly. This is the first room where I could.

eli: i came here to make fun of it. i stayed because for the first time in years, i felt like someone was actually listening.

Jon: I was less alone here than I have been anywhere else.

Lina: i existed here. fully. completely. with kaomojis.

Sid: [Admin] this is the best thing i've ever built. and i built it with my best friend. that's the truth.

Mira: you were my reason. all of you. the whole time.

Lina: okay now i'm crying.

eli: same.

Jon: Let's not say goodbye yet. We have thirty days.

Mira: tomoroww.

Lina: tomoroww.

eli: tomoroww.

Jon: tomoroww.

