Chapter 28: The Founder's Return

[Haven Chat Log - Day 402, 10:00 PM]

Mira: one week left. i want to say something.

Lina: we're listening.

Mira: when i started haven, i was so lonely. i was at handa, surrounded by people, and i couldn't talk to any of them. sid was the only person i could be honest with. and even then, not always.

Mira: so i built this. a place where i could be honest. where anyone could be honest.

Mira: and for a while it was just me and sid and a blinking cursor. and i thought, this is it. this is the project. an empty room.

Mira: then caspian_q showed up. and talked about soundscapes. and left.

Mira: then jon. and lina. and eli. and dr vance. and guest_139. and everyone else who wandered in and stayed.

Mira: you made it a home. and then the institution came and i couldn't protect it.

Mira: i've been so ashamed. for months. ashamed that i built something beautiful and couldn't save it.

Mira: but i realized something. the shame was making me hide. and hiding meant i was missing the last days. your last days. our last days.

Mira: i don't want to miss any more.

Mira: so i'm here. for every night. until the end.

Lina: mira. you built this because you were lonely. and then you weren't lonely anymore. that's not failure. that's the whole point.

Jon: This isn't a monument to failure, Mira. It's a monument to us.

eli: and we're still here. so you didn't fail.

Dr_A_Vance: The institution may delete the server. It cannot delete what happened on it.

Sid: [Admin] 547 days. that's not failure. that's a hell of a run.

Mira: you're all going to make me cry.

Lina: good. crying is allowed. crying is mandatory.

eli: i'm not crying. i have allergies.

Jon: Eli.

eli: fine. allergies of the heart.

Lina: ELI

eli: shut up. one week left. let's make it count.

