Chapter 29: The Last Ritual

[Haven Chat Log - Day 407, 11:00 PM]

[System Message: This room will be deleted in 60 minutes.]

Jon: Sixty minutes.

Lina: okay. okay. i thought i was ready. i'm not ready.

eli: no one's ready. that's the point.

Dr_A_Vance: I have been in many rooms that closed. Committee rooms. Classrooms. Offices. None of them felt like this.

Mira: what does this feel like?

Dr_A_Vance: Like the end of a book you never wanted to finish.

Sid: [Admin] i brought snacks. digital snacks. you can't eat them but they're there.

Lina: sid that's the most sid thing you've ever said.

Sid: [Admin] i'm coping. let me cope.

Jon: What do we do with sixty minutes?

Lina: we say the things we'll miss. i'll start. i'll miss the kaomoji reactions. especially eli pretending to hate them.

eli: i wasn't pretending.

Lina: you were.

eli: fine. i'll miss the kaomojis. (￣ω￣)

Lina: OH MY GOD

eli: one time. that was one time. don't make it weird.

Jon: I'll miss the hum. The heating system that started my first real conversation here.

Mira: i'll miss watching the logs. seeing someone new show up and stay. that moment of "oh, another one found us."

Dr_A_Vance: I will miss the silence between messages. The long timestamps. The way this room held space for thought in a world that demands speed.

Sid: [Admin] i'll miss debugging at 3 AM with mira. and complaining about the cafeteria coffee.

Mira: topsoil roast.

Sid: [Admin] the worst coffee on campus. i'll even miss that.

Lina: okay. new ritual. before the lights go out, everyone share their single favorite message from the entire history. the one that meant the most.

eli: easy. "tomoroww."

Lina: the typo?

eli: it's not a typo anymore. it's a promise. it means you'll be back.

Jon: Mine is from Day 245. "blinking means alive."

Mira: that was my line.

Jon: It was the first thing you ever said that I read. It stayed with me.

Dr_A_Vance: Mine is from Jon. "Or maybe you remembered it's not just a public chat either."

Jon: I remember that.

Dr_A_Vance: You saw me. Before I saw myself.

Sid: [Admin] mine is from the night the spam filter muted me. "best feature we ever built."

Mira: i stand by that. it was the best feature.

Lina: mine is from eli. "don't make it weird."

eli: that's your favorite?

Lina: you said it every time you were about to be sincere. it was your tell. i loved it.

eli: great. my legacy is a catchphrase.

Jon: A good catchphrase.

Mira: forty minutes left. what else?

Lina: we do the final line ritual. eli suggested it weeks ago. everyone gets one final line. not a goodbye. just something you want the universe to remember.

